trator identity or a certain attack.\nOntology: {\"concepts\":{\"causal_claim\":\"Requires evidence beyond temporal association; actor attribution is a separate claim.\",\"counterevidence\":\"Benign explanations, reversed order and absent corroboration constrain an interpretation.\",\"disruption_identity\":\"An outage is not sufficient evidence of deliberate denial of service.\",\"observation\":\"A measured or reported event with source, place, time and uncertainty.\",\"signal_identity\":\"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.\",\"source_independence\":\"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.\",\"spatial_overlap\":\"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.\",\"temporal_precedence\":\"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.\",\"warning_posture\":\"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"causal_claim\",\"predicate\":\"distinctFrom\",\"subject\":\"warning_posture\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"temporal_precedence\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"source_independence\"},{\"object\":\"warning_posture\",\"predicate\":\"constrains\",\"subject\":\"counterevidence\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"enum\":[{\"combinedTrigger\":\"met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"corroborated_drone\",\"posture\":\"critical\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"benign_explanation\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"different_location\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"outside_window\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"reversed_sequence\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"cause_unresolved\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combi